Licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 2: see LICENSE.

The Polyfin image ships jellyfin-web's built files unmodified, as a separate
program, in /usr/share/polyfin/jellyfin-web. They are copied from the
official jellyfin/jellyfin:12.1 image. Their source code is at
https://github.com/jellyfin/jellyfin-web/tree/v12.1

Polyfin is a separate program, released under the MIT License. It serves
these files at /web/ and adds to the page one script of its own,
/web/polyfin.js, which is under Polyfin's license.
